  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CADEC Bulawayo supplementary feeding for HIV-affected households</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">- 1200 Home Based Care Clients Households and Care Facilitators fed in the Districts of Bulilima, Mangwe and Matobo for 6 months.
- Promote increased participation of Care Facilitators, communities and vulnerable HBC households in the Livelihoods Programme Zimbabwe and ensure long-term sustainability.
- To improve the  nutritional and health status of targeted vulnerable HBC clients whose source of livelihoods is negatively impacted by their health status 
- Improved access to care and support for 1200 HIV affected households and Care Facilitators through HBC</narrative>
  </description>
